When I tried this a while back, I observed the following:
1)  To steal using a nymph/succubus/leprechaun, you bump into the monster, 
as if you were attacking.

2) A nymph/succubus will anger a priest(ess) if you try to steal something.

3) A leprechaun will anger a priest(ess) is you try to steal gold, and the 
priest has none. (The game treats this as an actual attack on the priest).

4) Your best bet is to give the priest some gold (to guarantee that he/she has
some for you to steal (to prevent #3)).  The bump into the priest with your
leprechaun to steal all his gold (I think you get it all at once, so you 
may not have to do it twice.)  Then #chat with the priest, give the XP 
level x 400 in zorkmids back to get the AC bonus, #chat again to give the 
rest of your money back (and pick up some clairvoyance time), and then steal 
it all over again.

Well, that's what worked for me.  I'm pretty sure that 1-3 are true, but I
haven't checked the source, so I can't guaratee anything....

